atutory Auditor</in-capmkt:DesignationOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:SalutationOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">M/s.</in-capmkt:SalutationOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement1">M/s. Gokhale &amp; Sathe LLP</in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement1">2026-09-22</in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange><in-capmkt:TermOfAppointmentInMonths contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1" unitRef="pure" decimals="INF">12</in-capmkt:TermOfAppointmentInMonths><in-capmkt:BriefProfile contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">M/s. Gokhale &amp; Sathe LLP Chartered Accountants has a legacy of over 40 years in professional services, the Firm brings together the collective expertise of 15 Partners and a dedicated team of over 200 people, delivering assurance, tax and advisory services to organizations across diverse sectors. 

They have extensive experience in statutory audits of listed companies, across both BFSI and Non-BFSI sectors, with a strong focus on financial reporting, regulatory requirements and good corporate governance, regulatory compliance and stakeholder confidence. Their BFSI practice is one of their key strengths, with significant expertise and experience in audits of banks, HFCs, NBFCs and other financial institutions. They also undertake risk-based internal audits and IFC reviews, helping businesses identify gaps, strengthen controls and manage risks effectively. Alongside assurance, they offer end to end Direct Tax and GST services encompassing advisory, compliance, litigation support, tax planning, due diligence and representation. They also have a dedicated Family-Owned Business Division that works closely with promoter-driven businesses, private limited companies, LLPs, partnership firms and professionals, providing practical support on assurance, taxation, structuring, succession planning and regulatory compliance.</in-capmkt:BriefProfile><in-capmkt:WhetherTheStatutoryAuditorOrSecretarialAuditorHoldsAValidCertificateIssuedByThePeerReviewBoardOfInstituteOfCharteredAccountantsOfIndiaOrInstituteOfCompanySecretariesOfIndia contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">true</in-capmkt:WhetherTheStatutoryAuditorOrSecretarialAuditorHoldsAValidCertificateIssuedByThePeerReviewBoardOfInstituteOfCharteredAccountantsOfIndiaOrInstituteOfCompanySecretariesOfIndia></xbrli:xbrl>
